{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04273","headline":"饯郑安阳入蜀 · 骆宾王","name":"饯郑安阳入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彭山折坂外，井络少城隈。\n地是三巴俗，人非百里材。\n畏途君怅望，岐路我裴徊。\n心赏风烟隔，容华岁月催。\n遥遥分凤野，去去转龙媒。\n遗锦非前邑，鸣琴即旧台。\n剑门千仞起，石路五丁开。\n海客乘槎渡，仙童驭竹回。\n魂将离鹤远，思逐断猿哀。\n唯有双凫舄，飞去复飞来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}